<title>TURKEY: Technical hitch halts trade on Istanbul Exchange.</title>
<headline>Technical hitch halts trade on Istanbul Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trading came to a standstill at Istanbul's Stock Exchange at 1108 GMT on Friday, eight minutes after the afternoon session opened, due to a technical problem in the automated trading system, brokers said.</p>
</text>
